question "Alex" {
    id=alex
    auto
    loop_to=theresa
    answer=[Alex] I guess it all started when I was 15
    answer=I meet this boy, *****
    answer=I mentioned him a couple times so far
    answer=Anyway, ***** was a year younger than me and my friends
    answer=But he was just so much cooler and funnier than us
    answer=He basically took our group by storm
    answer=I should mention, I was really sad back then
    answer=[overlay][at 0.3 0.14][size 1.6] Always so sullen
    answer=[overlay][at 0.66 0.24][size 0.8] But
    answer=[overlay][at 0.5 0.34][size 1.3] I met someone
    answer=[overlay][at 0.26 0.46][size 0.9] Who was kind enough
    answer=[overlay][at 0.72 0.55][size 0.8] To share
    answer=[overlay][at 0.5 0.66][size 2.4] Their happiness
    answer=[overlay][at 0.76 0.8][size 1.2] With me
    answer=Soon we were inseparable
    answer=We were starting bands
    answer=We were staying over at each other's houses every weekend
    answer=We would see each other all day, every day
    answer=Eventually he moved away
    answer=Back home, that is
    answer=But we still called pretty much every day
    answer=Now, I always knew ***** was autistic
    answer=So when I found out I had borderline
    answer=He was naturally the first person I reached out to
    answer=He really helped me
    answer=He was always a phone call away
    answer=He was never pandering or just humouring me
    answer=He listened
    answer=And he was always pushing me to be better, you know
    answer=To get out there and make friends, you know
    answer=He didn't want me to be defined by my diagnosis
    answer=He didn't want my life to be limited by anything
    answer=He really loved me
    answer=At least I think he did
    answer=I don't know anymore
    answer=Anyway, one day I'm out with friends
    answer=We're at a club and the music is really loud
    answer=After a few drinks I step outside for a cigarette and check my phone
    answer=[cutaway cutaways/phone] About 12 missed calls from *****
    answer=This was the first time he did something like that
    answer=I called him back
    answer=[overlay][center][size 1.4] I called
    answer=[overlay][fill][flash] Again
    answer=[overlay][fill][flash] And again
    answer=[room] Eventually he picked up
    answer=He was slurring his words
    answer=He told me he took a lot of pills
    answer=He sounded like he was relieved to hear my voice
    answer=He made it seem like he wanted me to save him
    answer=But he didn't ask
    answer=He just wanted to speak to me one last time
    answer=He was never going to give me the chance to save him
    answer=Even if I had picked up
    answer=I know that now
    answer=But still a part of me can't help but feel
    answer=[overlay][center][size 1.2] I
    answer=[overlay][center][size 1.5] Could
    answer=[overlay][center][size 1.8] Have
    answer=[overlay][center][size 2.1] Done
    answer=[overlay][center][size 2.6] Something
    answer=This understandably makes me break down
    answer=I was so guilty
    answer=So I made myself a deal
    answer=I would go to his funeral
    answer=I would see all my old friends and help them grieve
    answer=[title] And then I'd take my own life
    answer=I started practicing the second I got home from the funeral
    answer=I bought myself a small, sharp pocket knife
    answer=It had one of those snakes eating its tail
    answer=[cutaway cutaways/oraborus] That's when I started cutting
}

# The script labels Theresa's last two replies "Mel:" -- they follow on
# from Theresa's own story, so they're hers here.
question "Theresa" {
    id=theresa
    auto
    ending
    ending_text=End of Chapter 2
    answer=[Theresa] I was diagnosed with bipolar at 26
    answer=I, like many of my peers, always felt something was a bit off
    answer=But nothing serious till my first episode
    answer=It was so long ago now that I can't really remember it
    answer=Not that I remembered it a year after anyway
    answer=You can't really form long-lasting memories in an episode
    answer=While I may have forgotten how it felt and what exactly was wrong with me
    answer=I do remember this
    answer=I was 26
    answer=I was working then as a secretary at this law firm
    answer=That's when I met my now-passed husband, *******
    answer=I remember he was tall
    answer=And really funny
    answer=I remember how madly I fell in love with him so quickly
    answer=An episode will do that to you
    answer=I really lucked out though
    answer=If he was a total douche bag
    answer=Mind my language
    answer=I still would have fallen in love with him
    answer=That was the state of mind I was in
    answer=So yeah, I really lucked out
    answer=[cutaway cutaways/dragbar] I remember on our first date he accidentally took us to a gay bar
    answer=He was on stage dancing with the drag queens in about 30 minutes
    answer=He was so dynamic and vibrant
    answer=[room] Anyway, like always, that first episode turned sour
    answer=I completely lost it
    answer=I'll spare you the details
    answer=I'm sure you've heard everything you need to about psychosis at this point
    answer=To cut a long story short, I was in a bad way
    answer=I took a year off work
    answer=I was a complete mess
    answer=He never faltered
    answer=And I got better
    answer=For a time
    answer=Obviously this happens...
    answer=[overlay][fill][flash] Again
    answer=It always does
    answer=[overlay][at 0.4 0.13][size 0.9] That's the thing they don't tell you at the start
    answer=[overlay][at 0.45 0.28][size 1.6] It is for the rest of your life
    answer=[overlay][at 0.7 0.42][size 1.2] It's so hard to escape
    answer=[overlay][at 0.4 0.56][size 0.8] And you only get brief moments of respite
    answer=[overlay][at 0.5 0.72][size 1.8] So try to find someone who's kind
    answer=Anyway, I keep having episodes
    answer=And my husband continues to be the miraculous saviour he is
    answer=And I cheat
    answer=That's part of it too
    answer=The bipolar
    answer=He's furious
    answer=We spent time away from each other
    answer=He came back, though
    answer=I didn't even have to apologise
    answer=[P] How'd you get away with that, if you don't mind me interjecting?
    answer=[Theresa] About three months later
    answer=I found out I had early onset dementia
    answer=I don't know if you ever plan on cheating, but
    answer=That pretty much gives you a get out of jail free card
    answer=[P] I'm so sorry
    answer=[Theresa] Don't interrupt
    answer=[cutaway cutaways/livingroom] He died 3 years ago now
    answer=Ever since, I've just felt very lost
    answer=[room] So I did what I did in my youth
    answer=And started cutting again
}
